# HP50g stock ARMToolbox launch.
# SD contains only HPCLANG.HP. Enter the VVFAT volume so the file itself is
# highlighted, recall it through the stock File Manager, then open ARMToolbox
# directly from RS+LIB and execute PrRUN.
2000 chord lshift files
4200 capture files
4500 tap up
4800 tap f6
6500 capture sd
6900 tap enter
7600 capture sd-payload
8000 tap f4
9200 tap on
10000 chord rshift two
11250 capture lib
11600 tap f1
12900 capture armtoolbox
13300 tap f1
13600 monitor
